### 2.4 Cumulative Maximum Error – CME

Although different error metrics are calculated to evaluate the results of this simulation study, we focus on the 𝖢𝖬𝖤\mathsf{CME} ([5](https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2407.20158#S2.E5 "Equation 5 ‣ 3rd item ‣ 2.2 Prediction Task and Evaluation ‣ 2 Methodology ‣ Machine Learning for Predicting Chaotic Systems")), which we newly introduce for this study. If time is discrete, ([5](https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2407.20158#S2.E5 "Equation 5 ‣ 3rd item ‣ 2.2 Prediction Task and Evaluation ‣ 2 Methodology ‣ Machine Learning for Predicting Chaotic Systems")) becomes

